    },
    {
        "id": 7,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   We've arrived.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "We've arrived."
    },
    {
        "id": 8,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   ...What a depressing place.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "...What a depressing place."
    },
    {
        "id": 9,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\", name2=\"char_010_chen_1\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 10,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ch'en\"]   Any mention of this on the news?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ch'en",
        "content": "Any mention of this on the news?"
    },
    {
        "id": 11,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\", name2=\"char_010_chen_1\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 12,
        "raw": "[name=\"Hoshiguma\"]   None.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Hoshiguma",
        "content": "None."
    },
    {
        "id": 13,
        "raw": "[name=\"Hoshiguma\"]   By the looks of things, Ursus decided to abandon this place.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Hoshiguma",
        "content": "By the looks of things, Ursus decided to abandon this place."
    },
    {
        "id": 14,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\", name2=\"char_010_chen_1\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 15,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ch'en\"]   A deserted city, huh...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ch'en",
        "content": "A deserted city, huh..."
    },
    {
        "id": 16,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ch'en\"]   It this city has already become a Reunion stronghold, it's only going to cause more and more problems for Lungmen.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ch'en",
        "content": "It this city has already become a Reunion stronghold, it's only going to cause more and more problems for Lungmen."
    },
    {
        "id": 17,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\", name2=\"char_010_chen_1\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 18,
        "raw": "[name=\"Hoshiguma\"]   It's too close to Lungmen.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Hoshiguma",
        "content": "It's too close to Lungmen."
    },
    {
        "id": 19,
        "raw": "[name=\"Hoshiguma\"]   But if Skullshatterer was taking commands from this place, we can't afford to ignore it.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Hoshiguma",
        "content": "But if Skullshatterer was taking commands from this place, we can't afford to ignore it."
    },
    {
        "id": 20,
        "raw": "[name=\"Hoshiguma\"]   But... what exactly happened to this part of Chernobog?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Hoshiguma",
        "content": "But... what exactly happened to this part of Chernobog?"
    },
    {
        "id": 21,
        "raw": "[name=\"Hoshiguma\"]   It's impossible for it to have moved this far after being hit by the Catastrophe.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Hoshiguma",
        "content": "It's impossible for it to have moved this far after being hit by the Catastrophe."
    },
    {
        "id": 22,
        "raw": "[name=\"Hoshiguma\"]   And why would it appear here?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Hoshiguma",
        "content": "And why would it appear here?"
    },
    {
        "id": 23,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\", name2=\"char_002_amiya_1\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 24,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   From the observation data we've gathered... this happened in the aftermath of the Catastrophe.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "From the observation data we've gathered... this happened in the aftermath of the Catastrophe."
    },
    {
        "id": 25,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   Which means that this subsection was destroyed only after it reached here.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "Which means that this subsection was destroyed only after it reached here."
    },
    {
        "id": 26,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\", name2=\"char_002_amiya_1\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 27,
        "raw": "[name=\"Hoshiguma\"]   Hah. Seems like Rhodes Island has some skilled Catastrophe Messengers.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Hoshiguma",
        "content": "Hah. Seems like Rhodes Island has some skilled Catastrophe Messengers."
    },
    {
        "id": 28,
        "raw": "[name=\"Hoshiguma\"]   It's good to be cautious.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Hoshiguma",
        "content": "It's good to be cautious."
    },
    {
        "id": 29,
        "raw": "[name=\"Hoshiguma\"]   We've been ambushed by poorly-organized thugs our entire way here...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Hoshiguma",
        "content": "We've been ambushed by poorly-organized thugs our entire way here..."
    },
    {
        "id": 30,
        "raw": "[name=\"Hoshiguma\"]   Like vultures circling overhead, looking for carcasses among the ruins.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Hoshiguma",
        "content": "Like vultures circling overhead, looking for carcasses among the ruins."
    },
    {
        "id": 31,
        "raw": "[name=\"Hoshiguma\"]   It makes my skin crawl.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Hoshiguma",
        "content": "It makes my skin crawl."
    },
    {
        "id": 32,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\", name2=\"char_002_amiya_1\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 33,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   I've confirmed the coordinates. We'll have to continue moving deeper--",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "I've confirmed the coordinates. We'll have to continue moving deeper--"
    },
    {
        "id": 34,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   But judging from the terrain, we won't be able to move all our forces together.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "But judging from the terrain, we won't be able to move all our forces together."
    },
    {
        "id": 35,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\", name2=\"char_002_amiya_1\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 36,
        "raw": "[name=\"Hoshiguma\"]   Are we approaching the Originium-dense parts?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Hoshiguma",
        "content": "Are we approaching the Originium-dense parts?"
