    },
    {
        "id": 72,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   ...I didn't manage to get a good look either!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "...I didn't manage to get a good look either!"
    },
    {
        "id": 73,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   But that silhouette seemed like...",
